    "updated_at": "2020-10-01T16:52:37Z",
    "body": "Hi @khos2ow, You should be able to add an extra space as part of the format string without having multiple spaces get added where there is nothing to show. Can you try the following and let me know if that works for you?\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nformat = \"[$all_status$ahead_behind]($style) \"\r\n```",
