    "body": "Thanks @andytom, yes for sure I'll try again. This is the output based on your config suggestion:\r\n\r\n- in repo, with status\r\n  ```bash\r\n  my-repo on  master ! ➜ <-- your suggestion\r\n  my-repo on  master !➜  <-- current config\r\n  ```\r\n- in repo, without status\r\n  ```bash\r\n  my-repo on  master  ➜ <-- your suggestion\r\n  my-repo on  master ➜  <-- current config\r\n  ```\r\n- in a normal folder\r\n  ```bash\r\n  ~/work  ➜ <-- your suggestion\r\n  ~/work ➜  <-- current config\r\n  ```\r\n\r\nUpdate: May be this visualizes it a bit better:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nformat = \"'[$all_status$ahead_behind]($style) '\"\r\n```\r\n```bash\r\nmy-repo on  master '! '➜\r\nmy-repo on  master ' '➜\r\n~/work ' '➜\r\n```",
