    "updated_at": "2020-10-01T17:39:37Z",
    "body": "Ah thanks, I think I've worked out the problem, we need to wrap the whole string in `()`s so that it only renders the content if any of the variables are not empty.\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nformat = \"('[$all_status$ahead_behind]($style) ')\"\r\n```\r\n----\r\n**edit**\r\nor without the `'`s\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nformat = \"([$all_status$ahead_behind]($style) )\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
