    "updated_at": "2020-10-01T17:45:16Z",
    "body": "Oh that's so cool and fixed the issue.\r\n\r\nI don't remember seeing anything regarding `( )`s in the docs. Can you elaborate why enclosing the format string in the parentheses has this effect?\r\n\r\nUpdate: well it was in the doc ([reference](https://starship.rs/config/#conditional-format-strings)) and I had completely missed it!",
